[{"_1":2},"routes/docs-slug",{"_3":4},"data",{"_5":6,"_7":8},"content","# Introduction\n\nNovellis is a next-generation AI-powered writing assistant specifically designed for novel writers and world-builders. Unlike generic AI tools, Novellis understands the complex relationships, narrative arcs, and cultural nuances within your story.\n\n## Why Novellis?\n\nWriting a long-form novel is a monumental task. Keeping track of hundreds of characters, locations, and plot lines can be overwhelming. Novellis acts as your \"Narrative Intelligence\" layer—**a system that grows with your novel**, helping you maintain consistency and spark inspiration without forcing a rigid structure upfront.\n\n## Where to Start?\n\n- **[Core Concepts](/docs/concepts)**: Understand the architecture and local-first philosophy.\n- **[Onboarding Workflow](/docs/workflows)**: Step-by-step guide to starting your first project.\n- **[Installation](/docs/installation)**: Get up and running on your machine.\n","slug","intro"]
